# LLVM style, 160 columns, with: opening braces on their own line (Allman) and the pointer star next to the type (int* p).
# SortIncludes is off because include order matters in this tree (see CLAUDE.md "Header convention"); ReflowComments is off so that comments are only
# re-indented here and rewrapped in the later comment phase.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
ColumnLimit: 160
BreakBeforeBraces: Allman
PointerAlignment: Left
DerivePointerAlignment: false
SortIncludes: Never
ReflowComments: Never
